SUMMARY:Picture Your Path at McCaskey HS
DESCRIPTION:We’re excited to be hosting our first-ever event for prospective students! If you’re not currently a McCaskey student but could be someday\, come 𝗣𝗜𝗖𝗧𝗨𝗥𝗘 𝗬𝗢𝗨𝗥 𝗣𝗔𝗧𝗛 with us and 𝗗𝗜𝗦𝗖𝗢𝗩𝗘𝗥 𝗠𝗖𝗖𝗔𝗦𝗞𝗘𝗬 𝗛𝗜𝗚𝗛 𝗦𝗖𝗛𝗢𝗢𝗟 in just a few weeks. 🌪️ \nWe’ll be hosting a special evening for prospective students and their families! \nIf your child is currently in an SDoL middle school or elementary school\, charter school\, private school\, cyber school\, homeschool or any other school\, we’d love to meet you and answer your questions about McCaskey. \nThis is your chance to come inside and see what we’re all about.\nMore information will be coming soon! But for now\, save the date! \n🏫| 𝗣𝗜𝗖𝗧𝗨𝗥𝗘 𝗬𝗢𝗨𝗥 𝗣𝗔𝗧𝗛\n🗓️| May 14\n⏰| 3:30-8pm\n📍| McCaskey High School \nInterested in enrolling? For more information: https://sdlancaster.org/enroll-your-child/
URL:https://sdlancaster.org/event/picture-your-path-at-mccaskey-hs/
LOCATION:PA
CATEGORIES:All Events
END:VEVENT
