DTSTAMP:20260514T182322
CREATED:20260505T192156Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260505T192156Z
UID:10005681-1779203700-1779217200@sdlancaster.org
SUMMARY:FREE Sports Physicals for 2026-27 school year
DESCRIPTION:FREE SDoL ATHLETICS PHYSICALS \nGetting ready for the next school year starts now. The School District of Lancaster is offering free athletic physicals for student athletes entering grades 7 through 12 for the 2026–2027 school year. \n\nTuesday\, May 19\, 2026\n3:15 p.m. – 7:00 p.m.\nMcCaskey High School East (1051 Lehigh Ave.)\n\nAppointments are strongly encouraged and will be given priority\, but walk-ins will be accepted until 6:30 p.m. \nStudents should arrive during their scheduled time with Sections 1–5 of the PIAA physical paperwork already completed. \nTransportation will be available for SDoL students planning to participate in athletics during the 2026–2027 school year. \nThis opportunity supports our commitment to student health and wellness\, helping remove barriers so every student can participate and stay active. \nSign up and access forms: https://sdlancaster.org/discover-sdol/athletics/sports-medicine/  \nFor questions\, call 717-291-6236 or email Matthewbower@sdlancaster.org. \nPhysicals are offered in partnership with Penn Medicine Sports Medicine.
URL:https://sdlancaster.org/event/free-sports-physicals-for-2026-27-school-year/
LOCATION:PA
CATEGORIES:Buehrle Alternative,Jackson Middle,JP McCaskey HS,Lincoln Middle,Martin Middle,McCaskey East HS,McCaskey HS,Phoenix Academy,Reynolds Middle,Wheatland Middle
END:VEVENT
